OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold and crisp start for
OL,6,Fmost, with plenty of sunshine,
OL,7,Falthough a little cloudier for some
OL,8,Fcoastal areas. Cloud building a little
OL,9,Fthrough the day, however it will stay
OL,10,Fdry. Feeling cold with a chilly breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRather cloudy overnight,
OL,13,Fhowever a few clearer spells are
OL,14,Fpossible. Cold again, with a patchy
OL,15,Ffrost. Some low cloud is possible
OL,16,Facross western hills, perhaps with
OL,17,Fdrizzle, but otherwise dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
