OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAnother largely fine and dry
OL,6,Fday, but rather cloudy and breezy.
OL,7,FDespite some brighter or sunny
OL,8,Fintervals, this will lead to a rather
OL,9,Fcold feel.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLess
OL,12,Fcold on Sunday and Monday, but also
OL,13,Fturning changeable with spells of rain
OL,14,Falong with drier and brighter
OL,15,Fintervals. Staying unsettled on
OL,16,FTuesday, but potentially turning
OL,17,Fcolder again.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
